7. External ABI and architecture references
--------------------------------------------

lib/machina/arch/arm64/smmu_v3_internal.h models the ARM SMMUv3 programming
interface described by ARM IHI 0070. Register names, offsets, field positions,
command opcodes and event codes are architectural interface definitions. The
file's own BSD 3-Clause notice governs its implementation.
